        "Content": "DIRECTIONS:    In Rosslare proceed along the beach road passing Kelly’s Hotel on the right hand side.  Continue past Coast Hotel on the left and take the next left turn up Grange Road.  Proceed along here for approximately 350m and the entrance to Glor na Mara is on your left hand side.  Proceed into Glor na Mara and the property for sale is on the left – No. 5 (For Sale sign).  Eircode:  Y35 XP64"
